## Dependency Note

Task 169-003 (C1 Memory Relations Migration) is listed as pending. However
the `insertRelation` / `getRelations` / `countRelations` / `getRawDb` API
already exists on `MemoryStore` (memory-store.ts:515-555,670). The
169-007 safety wrapper depends only on this existing API surface, not on
the 169-003 backfill data. Implementation can proceed independently.

